{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":25,"count":40,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-3-09\",\"謝謝\",\"謝謝\",\"谢谢\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A：謝謝你。 B：不客氣。","pinyin":"A: Xièxie nǐ. B: Bú kèqi.","english":"A: Thank you. B: You are welcome.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-3-10","sourceFront":"不客氣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"老師：你們有問題嗎？ 學生：沒有。謝謝老師。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī: Nǐmen yǒu wèntí ma? Xuéshēng: Méi yǒu. Xièxie lǎoshī.","english":"Teacher: Do you have any questions? Student: No. Thank you, teacher.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-11","sourceFront":"問題","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們應該常常說請、謝謝。","pinyin":"Wǒmen yīnggāi chángcháng shuō qǐng, xièxie.","english":"We should say ‘please’, ‘thank you’ often.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-12","sourceFront":"應該","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"謝謝！明天晚上六點來我家，好不好？","pinyin":"Xièxie! Míngtiān wǎnshang liù diǎn lái wǒ jiā, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"Thanks! How about coming to my place at 6 p.m. tomorrow?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"找您七百八十五塊錢，謝謝。","pinyin":"Zhǎo nín qī bǎi bāshíwǔ kuài qián, xièxie.","english":"Here is your 785 dollars of change, thanks.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"謝謝，這是我去年的生日禮物。","pinyin":"Xièxie, zhè shì wǒ qùnián de shēngrì lǐwù.","english":"Thanks, this is my birthday gift from last year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"好，謝謝醫生。","pinyin":"Hǎo, xièxie yīshēng.","english":"Okay, Thank you doctor.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"謝(thank), said twice: 謝謝(thank you)."},{"key":"[\"B1L02-3-04\",\"午饭\",\"午飯\",\"午饭\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:這些點心夠不夠？ B:夠了，夠了，我們已經吃過午飯了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-08","sourceFront":"夠","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L02-3-05\",\"早飯\",\"早飯\",\"早饭\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我平常早上七點起床，八點吃早飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng zǎoshang qī diǎn qǐchuáng, bā diǎn chī zǎofàn.","english":"I usually get up at seven and have breakfast at eight in the morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-11","sourceFront":"平常","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"早(early) + 飯(meal) → the early meal is breakfast."},{"key":"[\"B1L08-2-08\",\"袜子\",\"襪子\",\"袜子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想買一雙黑色的鞋子和一雙白色的襪子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-11","sourceFront":"黑","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"室友老是把髒襪子扔在地上，希望他能把這個壞習慣改掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-25","sourceFront":"扔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我買了一雙除臭的襪子送給他。 (V)","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-22","sourceFront":"除","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-07\",\"禮拜\",\"禮拜\",\"礼拜\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們班只能禮拜一跟禮拜二下午用。","pinyin":"Wǒmen bān zhǐ néng lǐbài yī gēn lǐbài èr xiàwǔ yòng.","english":"Our class can only use it in the afternoon on Mondays and Tuesdays.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"禮拜 means week. It comes from 禮(ceremony)+拜(worship), the weekly worship day."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-10\",\"照相机\",\"照相機\",\"照相机\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:這個照相機是誰的？ B:是我爸爸的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L11-3-10","sourceFront":"照相機","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個照相機貴得不得了，我買不起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-13","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我承認你的照相機是被我弄壞的，我一定負責把它修理好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-13","sourceFront":"承認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這支手機的照相功能很強，拍出來的效果比照相機還要好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-28","sourceFront":"效果","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-04\",\"刚刚\",\"剛剛\",\"刚刚\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我剛剛在學校附近看到中明。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-04","sourceFront":"剛剛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"山本良介還在台灣學中文，他的中文課明年二月才結束。我今天有三個小時的數學課，剛剛才下課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-26","sourceFront":"才","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你剛剛說要吃漢堡，現在說要吃炸雞，到底要吃什麼？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-44","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們剛剛在燒竹子的時候，火非常大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-18","sourceFront":"火","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"剛剛大家推來推去的，結果把瓶子給打破了，這算誰的錯？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-52","sourceFront":"算","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛剛忘了把垃圾拿出去丟，還好你提醒我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-11","sourceFront":"提醒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你那一付筷子剛剛掉到地上弄髒了，我再幫你換一付新的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-40","sourceFront":"付","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L14-2-14\",\"這麼\",\"這麼/那麼\",\"这么/那么\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那麼我們現在去找他。","pinyin":"Nàme wǒmen xiànzài qù zhǎo tā.","english":"Let’s go ask him now.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"這(this) + 麼(particle) → 'this way', so 'so'."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-2-10\",\"雨衣\",\"雨衣\",\"雨衣\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-24\",\"喜愛\",\"喜愛\",\"喜爱\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我妹妹非常喜愛像Hello Kitty那樣的卡通人物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-24","sourceFront":"喜愛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那場演唱會請到了大家最喜愛的明星，所以門票很快就被搶光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位服裝設計師相當喜愛十八世紀時的歐洲傳統風格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-02","sourceFront":"世紀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小寒特別喜愛射氣球遊戲，每次去逛夜市時總要完五、六回。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-05","sourceFront":"射","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-34\",\"義大利\",\"義大利\",\"义大利\",\"Name\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去義大利旅行的時候，不小心把護照弄丟了，我擔心死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-13","sourceFront":"死","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這所大學的外語學院有英文系、日文系、德文系和義大利文系。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-14","sourceFront":"學院","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本書的內容很有意思，介紹了很多義大利的飲食文化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-03","sourceFront":"內容","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天的歐洲足球賽，法國對義大利的比賽真是太刺激了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家義大利餐廳太貴了，除非打折，要不然我不會去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-12","sourceFront":"除非","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-24\",\"表现\",\"表現\",\"表现\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次的比賽很重要，大家一定要好好地表現。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"東賢演什麼像什麼，每部戲都演得非常好，觀眾對他的表現非常肯定","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-29","sourceFront":"肯定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我舅舅在公司的表現樣樣都好，所以老闆打算明年讓他當經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-30","sourceFront":"樣樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母除了教導孩子做人做事的道理，也應該肯定他們的表現，讓他們更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-08","sourceFront":"教導","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"石經理對員工很兇，回家後卻能表現出溫柔的一面，非常體貼太太。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-31","sourceFront":"面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"顏小姐的職場表現很優秀，除了外文能力好，做事也很細心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-28","sourceFront":"優秀","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"面試時必須穿正式的服裝，跟老闆對話時，也應表現出客氣、 謙虛的態度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-24","sourceFront":"應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張老師認真觀察學生們的表現，這樣才能了解他們的心理和學習情況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-23","sourceFront":"觀察","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類的智慧表現在思考、溝通、欣賞、創造等方面。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-04","sourceFront":"智慧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母對孩子表現的肯定，就是給孩子最好的鼓勵。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-10","sourceFront":"鼓勵","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了在這場鋼琴演奏中有優秀的表現，小戴早晚不停地練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-05","sourceFront":"演奏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當別人表現得很好時，別忘了為他們鼓掌，給他們鼓勵。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-12","sourceFront":"鼓掌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"球員的表現讓教練不斷搖頭，並表示得加強平常的訓練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-31","sourceFront":"搖頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂團主唱的唱歌技巧，對樂團演出表現的影響相當大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-45","sourceFront":"主唱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你面臨困難或挑戰時，也正是表現個人智慧與能力的最佳時刻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-17","sourceFront":"面臨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小戴在這場籃球比賽中表現相當優秀，投中了三十多分，因此被教練選中，代表學校參加全國比賽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-16","sourceFront":"中","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孫小姐最近談成了幾筆大生意，表現出色，於是公司決定提高她的薪水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-17","sourceFront":"出色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的球隊因為練習不夠，這一季的表現也不太理想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-50","sourceFront":"球隊","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-2-01\",\"邀請\",\"邀請\",\"邀请\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華語文中心的學生邀請台灣朋友來參加世界文化日的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-01","sourceFront":"邀請","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校邀請李教授來演講，內容相當精彩，讓我有很大的收穫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-30","sourceFront":"精彩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你帶著邀請卡給門口的服務人員檢查，才能入場參加活動。","pinyin":"","english":""