"重大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現代企業越來越重視員工的福利和健康，例如提供免費的旅遊和健檢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-03","sourceFront":"企業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這家公司福利不錯，每年除了提供免費健檢，老闆還會帶員工出國旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-30","sourceFront":"福利","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"假如貴公司想擴大生產規模，可以參考本公司的作法，我們很願意提供協助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-06","sourceFront":"參考","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了提供學生良好的學習環境，學校改善了教室的設備，網路的速度也變快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-06","sourceFront":"良好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個國家公園的服務中心提供遊客簡介，介紹公園的特色和有名的景點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-03","sourceFront":"簡介","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"發生大地震後，民眾都發揮愛心，主動提供救災的相關用品給災民。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-09","sourceFront":"相關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A: 現在的科技提供非常好用的網路服務，而且很多都是免費的。 B: 好用倒是好用，可是萬一沒有網路，就什麼都做不了了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-05","sourceFront":"倒是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我的房東只提供家具、電視和冰箱，以外的東西他不管。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-19","sourceFront":"以外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那兩家便利商店同樣提供客人休息的座位，但是第二家的空間比第一家大多了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-24","sourceFront":"同樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這所大學有最新的電腦設備，提供學生很好的學習環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-15","sourceFront":"設備","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家廣告公司提供了五個工作機會，只要是設計系畢業的都可以去試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-07","sourceFront":"提供","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了吸引人才，廣告企業提供獎金給優秀的設計師。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-36","sourceFront":"獎金","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A generous 亻(person) gathers supplies together so community members 共(together) have enough to eat and drink: 供(supply)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"包\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 勹(wrap) rests gently around a sleeping 巳(curl) → 包(wrap)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"堅\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A strict supervisor 臤(oversee) directs workers to tamp the damp 土(soil) until it turns rock 堅(hard)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"屋頂\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 屋(building) and 頂(top): 屋頂 means roof."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"工作\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"工(labor) + 作(do) → doing labor is 工作 \"work\"."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"教材\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 教(education) a 材(timber): 教材 means teaching material."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"椅\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 木(tree) stands like a 奇(strange) perch → the 椅(chair)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"清\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Clear mountain 氵(water) that flows as pure as pristine 青(blue-green) skies is sparkling and 清(clean)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"皮包\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Leather (皮) wrap (包) → a wallet is a leather wrap for your money."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"紅\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 糹(silk) takes the 工(work) dye → a wedding banner of 紅(red)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"者\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"an 耂(old) man counts each 日(sun) at the market gate → 者(person)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"醫院\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"醫(doctor) + 院(institution) → the institution for doctors, a hospital."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"隨便\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 隨(follow) and 便(easy): 隨便 means careless."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"颱風\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 颱(platform) and 風(wind): 颱風 means typhoon."}]}
